K.14 — Sign Convention Summary

Ref.: Appendix A.4, B.8, B.9.

```
   CURVATURE
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────
        convex   →   ρ > 0
        concave  →   ρ < 0
        signs constructed per geometry (inner / outer /
        row / four-point), not transferred by analogy.

   CONTACT FORCE AND COMPRESSION
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────
        Q_i ≥ 0          (compression; tension inadmissible)
        δ_ij ≥ 0         (compression)
        g_ij ≥ 0         (residual gap)
        Q_i · g_i = 0    (complementarity)
        δ_ij ↑  ⇒  Q_ij ↑
        δ_ij  = -g_ij

   RING RADIAL DISPLACEMENT
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────
        w > 0 outward (away from ring centre)
        G_kl = radial displacement at sector k per unit
               radial force at sector l (positive outward)

   SLIDING DISSIPATION
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────
        P_sl,diss = - Σ_c ∫_Ac τ_c · v_sl,c dA  ≥ 0
        τ_c   = traction on body 1 from body 2
        v_sl  = v_1 - v_2   (relative velocity of 1 w.r.t. 2)
        τ_c opposes v_sl (Coulomb):  τ_c · v_sl ≤ 0

   NET GAIN
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────
        P_net  =  P_total,ref  -  P_total,DLMR
               positive  ⇒  DLMR advantage
               decision  :  ΔP_net > U_total
```

